Name "Mek_Compressing_Factory"

Every 20 ticks do

    Input avaritia:neutron_ingot From ME_Face Top Side Slots 0
        Output retain 8 avaritia:neutron_ingot To Each Neutron Bottom Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:ingot_osmium From ME_Face Top Side Slots 1
        Output retain 8 mekanism:ingot_osmium To Each Osmium Bottom Side
    forget

    Input From Each Compressing_Factory Top Side
        Output To ME_Face Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget 

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input etshtinker:gs_indused_netherite_dust From Ingredient Top Side
        Output etshtinker:gs_indused_netherite_dust To Neutron Top Side
    forget

    Input kubejs:compressed_hardlead From Ingredient Top Side
        Output kubejs:compressed_hardlead To Neutron Top Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:dust_refined_obsidian From Ingredient Top Side
        Output mekanism:dust_refined_obsidian To Osmium Top Side
    forget


End